cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use IPFD in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "IPFD: Isaac Policy Failure Debugger"
abstract: >-
  A headless debugging utility for robot-policy rollouts in Isaac Lab that
  localizes the Point of No Return, the first timestep a manipulation episode is
  irrecoverable under a provided recovery oracle, and reports whether any internal
  signal predicted the failure before it was externally observable. Scope is
  Franka Emika Panda single-object pick-and-place.
type: software
authors:
